## 17. UML Inheritance

In UML, inheritance is usually shown with a line and hollow triangle pointing to the superclass.

Text version:

```text
Dog ─────▷ Animal
Cat ─────▷ Animal
```

Or:

```text
        Animal
       /      \
     Dog      Cat
```

### Class Diagram Example

```text
Animal
-------------------
name
age
-------------------
eat()
makeSound()

Dog extends Animal
-------------------
breed
-------------------
makeSound()
fetch()
```

### Interpretation

```text
Dog inherits name, age, eat()
Dog overrides makeSound()
Dog adds breed and fetch()
```

