## 26. Worked Example: School People

### Scenario

A school system stores teachers and students.

Common data:

```text
name
email
dateOfBirth
```

Student-specific data:

```text
gradeLevel
studentID
```

Teacher-specific data:

```text
subject
staffID
```

### Possible Design

```text
Person
├── Student
└── Teacher
```

### Explanation

`Student` is a `Person`.  
`Teacher` is a `Person`.

So inheritance is suitable.

